  "description": "Download Rec Room - Join your friends! Totally free and simple to install. Completely secure, no threats or malware. Always stay up-to-date with the newest version effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "Rec Room is the premiere social platform where you can create and enjoy games with friends globally. 🌍🎮 Dive into an array of user-generated rooms, from high-energy PVP confrontations to engaging role-playing environments. Personalize your avatar and dorm room to express your individuality. Use the Maker Pen to unleash your creativity and craft everything from adorable animals to exciting adventures. Connect with friends via voice and text chatting, and participate in classes, groups, live events, and competitions. 🎉 Embrace the excitement in Rec Room today and engage with a lively and friendly community!",
